            "text": "Press Start exercise below to start the mic and the band: four chords, a bar each, round and round. Sing one long note per chord on \"oo\": {{7}}, up to {{1}}, {{1}} again, then back down to {{7}}. Then sing the other line: {{3}}, up to {{5}}, down to {{4}}, then {{4}} again. From {{3}} up to {{5}} is a minor 3rd, the leap of the day.\nOnce the leap lands without a slide, sing both lines in another key. Use the Key selector below to change the key, then press Start exercise again.\nWhen you change the key, the chords are new but the first line still moves by half steps and the second still opens with a minor 3rd."
